OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen's 'constructive'
OL,4,Ameeting with first minister over toxic
OL,5,Adumping claims
OL,6,
OL,7,FHollywood actor Michael Sheen said he
OL,8,Fhad a "constructive" meeting with First
OL,9,FMinister Rhun ap Iorwerth over toxic
OL,10,Fdumping claims raised in his BBC
OL,11,Fdocumentary.
OL,13,FBuried with Michael Sheen explores
OL,14,Ftoxic chemical dumping in 14 sites in
OL,15,FWales and England.
OL,17,FSheen initially said an offer to meet
OL,18,Fthe first minister "was not taken up"
OL,19,Fbefore the documentary was broadcast in
OL,20,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
