OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Sheen's 'constructive'
OL,4,Ameeting with first minister over toxic
OL,5,Adumping claims
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, the Welsh actor said he
OL,8,Fmet the first minister, speaking about
OL,9,Fhow they could move forward adding it
OL,10,Fwas "early days but that's really
OL,11,Fencouraging".
